+| W13 | `5506b1a9` | Wayland: pixel-only wheel, wheel-tilt and continuous scrolls report `Moved`, so Ctrl zoom doesn't stay latched | none; to be proposed | upstream fix | pdfcraft vendor patch (13), pdfcraft#1569 |
