+/// Additional methods on [`WindowAttributes`] that are specific to MacOS.
+///
+/// **Note:** Properties dealing with the titlebar will be overwritten by the
+/// [`WindowAttributes::with_decorations`] method:
+/// - `with_titlebar_transparent`
+/// - `with_title_hidden`
